Package: claude-agent
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: crunchtools <scott.mccarty@crunchtools.com>
Depends: claude-code, python3 (>= 3.9), bash, jq
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/crunchtools/claude-agent
Description: run Claude Code as an unattended agent
 claude-agent run holds an interactive session in a pty and takes prompts
 over a local socket, holding them while a turn runs. It ships the hooks an
 unattended Claude Code session needs:
 circuit breakers that halt a conversation that has run away, an audit
 record of every tool call, and an opt-in hook that answers permission
 prompts. The hooks act only in sessions started with CLAUDE_AGENT=1.
